Set Shell "bash"
Set FontFamily "JetBrainsMono Nerd Font"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1200
Set Height 700
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Padding 12

Hide
Type "nobetci --demo"
Enter
Sleep 30s
Show
Sleep 2s
Screenshot assets/overview.png
Sleep 1s

Enter
Sleep 4s
Screenshot assets/detail.png
Sleep 1s

Type "l"
Sleep 3s
Type "/"
Type "hata"
Enter
Sleep 4s
Screenshot assets/logs.png
Sleep 1s

Escape
Sleep 1s
Escape
Sleep 1s
Escape
Sleep 1s
Type "a"
Sleep 4s
Screenshot assets/alerts.png
Sleep 1s
Type "a"
Type "q"
Sleep 500ms
